SUMMARY:Glow in the Dark Boulder Bash at BOO-ulderz Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Hey BOO-ulderz Family! \nIt’s officially Glow in the Dark Boulder Bash at Boulderz Toronto on Friday\, October 30th! (5:00 PM to 11:00 PM) \nDoors open at 5:00 PM. Your RSVP guarantees entry\, but only 90 spots are available\, so make sure you reserve a spot to come BAT-HANG with us! \nEntry requires facility access with a membership\, punch pass\, or Admission. (No complimentary passes or guest passes permitted). \n(No complimentary passes or guest passes permitted). \nWhat’s Happening? \n\n\nGlow in the Dark Halloween Climbing Comp & Challenges: Test yourself on spooky problems and fun climbing challenges. \n\n\nComplimentary Food & Drinks: Fuel up between sends with Pizza\, Snacks & Refreshments (while supplies last!) \n\n\nCostumes\, Community Beats & Spooky Vibes: Come dressed in your Halloween best (climb-safe!)\, vibe out to our community-driven Halloween playlist with our host Victoria\, and tag @boulderzclimbing in your best spooky sends to get featured on our Stories! \n\nPhoto Booth -Snap your best photo or Reel during the party and tag @boulderzclimbing with #BoulderzHalloween to enter our post-event photo contest!\n\nREGISTER NOW
URL:https://boulderzclimbing.com/event/boulder-bash-at-boulderz-toronto/
LOCATION:Toronto\, 1444 Dupont St #16\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6P 4H3\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://boulderzclimbing.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/DSC_0003-Alexandra-Thurm-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
