SUMMARY:Adaptive Community Climbing Event
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an inclusive climbing experience in partnership with the Canadian Adaptive Climbing Society! \nWhether you’re an experienced climber or trying it out for the first time\, this event is designed for individuals of all abilities to come together and enjoy the thrill of climbing in a supportive and welcoming environment. \nAdmission will include rentals of rock climbing shoes\, harness\, and chalk. \nREGISTER NOW \nVOLUNTEER \n  \n 
URL:https://boulderzclimbing.com/event/adaptive-community-climbing-event-4/
LOCATION:Etobicoke\, 80 The East Mall Unit 9\, Etobicoke\, Ontario\, M8Z 5X1\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://boulderzclimbing.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Adaptive_814_WEB_Eduardo_Boulderz_2025.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Boulderz Etobicoke":MAILTO:etobicoke@boulderzclimbing.com
END:VEVENT
